<h1>Registration Menu</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>This menu contains commands for registering, automatically and manually aligning entities. This menu is divided in 2 sections as follow:</p>
<table cellspacing="0" class="whs4">
<col class="whs5">
<col class="whs6">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="219px" class="whs8">
<p><img src="Images/registration.gif" width="218px" height="113px" border="0" class="img_whs9" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td valign="middle" width="235px" class="whs10">
<table cellspacing="0" width="100%" class="whs11">
<col class="whs12">
<tr valign="middle" class="whs13">
<td valign="bottom" width="100%" class="whs14">
<p>Registration steps</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs15">
<td valign="middle" width="100%" class="whs16">
<p>Rotate and Translate</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="sub-head">Registration steps group</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="802" class="whs17">
<col class="whs18">
<col class="whs19">
<col class="whs20">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="17.082%" class="whs21">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="74.314%" class="whs22">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="4.125%" class="whs23">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.082%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Pick Feature Points</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="74.314%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">First step of the registration process. This command activates <span class="Mode">Pick Feature points</span> mode to set points for registration.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Pick_Feature_Points.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.082%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Register</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="74.314%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">Second step of the registration process. The command <span lang="EN-GB">aligns two different surfaces using the picked feature points in step one.</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Register.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.082%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Align Entities</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="74.314%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">Third step of the registration process. This command uses best fit algorithm to align two entities in order to obtain maximum overlapping between them. Entities can be scan data, meshes or point clouds.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/align_entities.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="sub-head">Rotate and Translate group:</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="803" class="whs28">
<col class="whs29">
<col class="whs30">
<col class="whs20">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="17.186%" class="whs31">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="74.222%" class="whs32">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="4.125%" class="whs23">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.186%" class="whs33">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Rotate and Translate</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="74.222%" class="whs34">
<p class="normal-table">This command offers different ways for manual adjustment of entities in the space.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Rotate_and_Translate.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
